{"id":"n57733-1-7","stage":4,"title":"미남 · 美男子","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57733-1-7-1","ko":"우리 둘 중에 누가 더 미남이에요?","zh":"我们俩谁更帅？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"둘","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}},{"text":"중에","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중에","audio":"/audio/f0d257645978930f07ec.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"미남이에요?","meaning":"美男子，帅哥","explanation":"미남：美男子，帅哥；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"미남","audio":"/audio/b5255df2712a06ee1a6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57733","senseId":"1","lemma":"미남","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading